Compass for Linux
=================

Run ./compass from this folder.

Renderers are sandboxed with user namespaces. Where those are restricted
(Ubuntu 24.04 and later), Compass needs its setuid helper; unpacking as root
keeps it, otherwise run once:

  sudo chown root:root chrome-sandbox && sudo chmod 4755 chrome-sandbox

For a menu entry, edit Exec= and Icon= in compass.desktop to this folder's
compass and product_logo_256.png, then copy it to ~/.local/share/applications.
